  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Zambia: Feasibility Study Mulonga Solar and Storage, through Bates White LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Grant to REV-Up Ventures Zambia funds a feasibility study to assess the technical, economic, and financial viability of developing and implementing a multi-phase 200-megawatt solar photovoltaic energy generation project with an integrated 800-megawatt hour (MWh) battery energy storage system in the Mulonga region of Zambia. The Project would supply clean, reliable energy to the Zambia market as well as the Democratic Republic of the Congo through a nearby planned interconnecting transmission line.</narrative>
  </description>
